%% aoneahsan-cccs-url-state-persistence — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Adding or reviewing UI state]) --> test{Could someone paste this URL<br/>and see the SAME screen —<br/>and should they?}

    test -->|no| transient{Is it loading, hover, focus,<br/>in-flight submit, validation,<br/>uncommitted input or animation?}
    transient -->|yes| local[useState is correct.<br/>URL-encoding these creates history<br/>noise and a jittery address bar]
    transient -->|no| reconsider[Re-read the table —<br/>most UI state IS shareable]
    reconsider --> test

    test -->|yes| which{Which state is it?}
    which -->|modal / drawer| p1[?compose=1 or ?edit=id]
    which -->|tab or section| p2[?tab= / ?section=]
    which -->|form step| p3[?step=]
    which -->|accordion| p4[?open=a,b]
    which -->|filter / sort / page| p5[?status= &sort= &dir= &page=]
    which -->|selected entity| p6[?view=id]
    which -->|search| p7[?q=]

    p1 --> naming
    p2 --> naming
    p3 --> naming
    p4 --> naming
    p5 --> naming
    p6 --> naming
    p7 --> naming
    naming[Use the FLEET-WIDE param names —<br/>compose, edit, view, tab, section,<br/>step, page, q, status, range]
    naming --> default{Is the value the default?}
    default -->|yes| omit[OMIT the param.<br/>?tab=overview when overview is<br/>the default is noise]
    default -->|no| hook
    omit --> hook

    hook[Read/write via the shared hooks in<br/>lib/hooks/useUrlState.ts — never<br/>hand-parse URLSearchParams per component]
    hook --> history{Should Back undo this?}
    history -->|yes — modal opened,<br/>wizard advanced| push[PUSH — Back closes the modal<br/>instead of leaving the page]
    history -->|no — filter, search,<br/>tab switch| replace[REPLACE — the user should not<br/>press Back ten times to escape]

    push --> legacy
    replace --> legacy
    legacy{Does a legacy path route<br/>just open this modal?}
    legacy -->|yes| redirect["navigate to the URL-synced<br/>equivalent with replace: true —<br/>old links keep working,<br/>one source of truth"]
    legacy -->|no| verify
    redirect --> verify

    local --> verify
    verify([Verify: refresh mid-flow lands in the<br/>SAME place; a pasted link reproduces it])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class test,transient,which,default,history,legacy gateNode
    class trigger,verify terminal
